  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Seven tales from The Mabinogion introduced &amp; abridged by Shirley Jones, but still preserving their full flavour, with her translation ... of passages selected to convey the humour, irony &amp; lyricism that permeate these stories. Seven of her images in mezzotint, aquatint &amp; relief etching are interleaved with Unryusi tissue printed with the Welsh passages they illustrate. ...": colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">" ...The English text was set ... at Gwasg Gregynog, &amp; printed throughout by Shirley Jones ... in an edition of 40."  Cf. colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">In green cloth backed in green leather stamped in gold; decorated pastepaper endpapers, as issued in a green cloth box measuring 41 cm.</subfield>
  </datafield>
